{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-management","title":"运行时内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/performance/memory-management","wordCount":915,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"运行时内存管理\">运行时内存管理</h1><p>Electron 应用的内存消耗是用户和开发者共同关注的焦点。每个 BrowserWindow 对应一个独立的 Chromium 渲染进程，加上 GPU 进程、网络进程和主进程本身，一个看似简单的单窗口应用在空闲时就可能占用 200-400MB 内存。对于长时间运行的桌面应用，内存泄漏和无节制的增长会逐渐侵蚀系统资源，直到用户被迫重启应用。本文提供一套从诊断到治理的系统性内存管理方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[Electron 应用总内存] --&gt; B[主进程 ~80MB]&#10;    A --&gt; C[渲染进程 ×N ~100MB/个]&#10;    A --&gt; D[GPU 进程 ~200-300MB]&#10;    A --&gt; E[网络进程 ~30MB]&#10;    A --&gt; F[工具进程 ~20MB/个]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; G[V8 Heap]&#10;    C --&gt; H[DOM/Blink]&#10;    C --&gt; I[共享内存/位图]\">graph TB\n    A[Electron 应用总内存] --&gt; B[主进程 ~80MB]\n    A --&gt; C[渲染进程 ×N ~100MB/个]\n    A --&gt; D[GPU 进程 ~200-300MB]\n    A --&gt; E[网络进程 ~30MB]\n    A --&gt; F[工具进程 ~20MB/个]\n\n    C --&gt; G[V8 Heap]\n    C --&gt; H[DOM/Blink]\n    C --&gt; I[共享内存/位图]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>进程类型</th>\n<th>空闲内存</th>\n<th>主要消耗来源</th>\n<th>可优化空间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主进程</td>\n<td>60-100MB</td>\n<td>Node.js 堆、模块缓存</td>\n<td>模块裁剪、缓存清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染进程</td>\n<td>80-150MB</td>\n<td>V8 堆、DOM 树、位图</td>\n<td>组件卸载、虚拟化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 进程</td>\n<td>200-350MB</td>\n<td>纹理缓存、合成缓冲区</td>\n<td>无法直接控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络进程</td>\n<td>20-50MB</td>\n<td>HTTP 缓存、Socket 池</td>\n<td>缓存策略配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内存泄漏的常见模式\">内存泄漏的常见模式</h2><p>Electron 应用中的内存泄漏通常发生在以下场景：</p>\n<p><strong>未清理的事件监听器</strong>：最常见的泄漏来源。渲染进程中注册的 IPC 监听器、DOM 事件监听器、或第三方库的回调在组件卸载后未被移除，导致被引用的闭包和关联对象无法被 GC 回收。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 泄漏模式&#10;useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;  const handler = (_e: unknown, data: unknown) =&gt; setData(data);&#10;  window.electronAPI.onDataUpdate(handler);&#10;  // 缺少 cleanup！组件卸载后 handler 仍被 IPC 持有&#10;}, []);&#10;&#10;// 正确模式&#10;useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;  const unsubscribe = window.electronAPI.onDataUpdate((data) =&gt; {&#10;    setData(data);&#10;  });&#10;  return () =&gt; unsubscribe(); // 组件卸载时取消订阅&#10;}, []);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 泄漏模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window.electronAPI.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onDataUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 缺少 cleanup！组件卸载后 handler 仍被 IPC 持有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unsubscribe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.electronAPI.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onDataUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> unsubscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 组件卸载时取消订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, []);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>已销毁窗口的引用残留</strong>：主进程持有对已关闭窗口的 <code>webContents</code> 引用，或定时器中捕获了已销毁的 BrowserWindow 对象。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 泄漏模式&#10;const wins: BrowserWindow[] = [];&#10;function createWindow() {&#10;  const win = new BrowserWindow({});&#10;  wins.push(win); // win 关闭后仍在数组中被引用&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 正确模式&#10;win.on(&#39;closed&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  const idx = wins.indexOf(win);&#10;  if (idx !== -1) wins.splice(idx, 1);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 泄漏模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BrowserWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> win</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BrowserWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  wins.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(win); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// win 关闭后仍在数组中被引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">win.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'closed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wins.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">indexOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(win);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) wins.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">splice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(idx, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>累积的缓存数据</strong>：应用内缓存（如图片缓存、计算结果缓存）无上限增长，缺少 LRU 淘汰或 TTL 过期机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存诊断工具\">内存诊断工具</h2><p><strong>Chrome DevTools Memory 面板</strong>：对渲染进程做堆快照（Heap Snapshot），对比两个快照的差异可精确定位泄漏对象。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 开发模式下暴露手动 GC 能力&#10;if (!app.isPackaged) {&#10;  app.commandLine.appendSwitch(&#39;js-flags&#39;, &#39;--expose-gc&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 在渲染进程中触发 GC 后拍快照，排除短期对象的干扰\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 开发模式下暴露手动 GC 能力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.isPackaged) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  app.commandLine.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendSwitch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'js-flags'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--expose-gc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在渲染进程中触发 GC 后拍快照，排除短期对象的干扰</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>主进程内存监控</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { memoryUsage } from &#39;node:process&#39;;&#10;&#10;setInterval(() =&gt; {&#10;  const { heapUsed, heapTotal, rss } = memoryUsage();&#10;  console.log(&#10;    `[memory] heap: ${(heapUsed / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(1)}MB / ` +&#10;      `${(heapTotal / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(1)}MB, RSS: ${(rss / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(1)}MB`,&#10;  );&#10;}, 30000);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { memoryUsage } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:process'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setInterval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">heapUsed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">heapTotal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> memoryUsage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span